[{"id":"app-testing-crash-vs-anr","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["故障诊断","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(五)ADB 诊断与证据.md","articleTitle":"App测试(五)ADB 诊断与证据","articlePath":"posts/16f2c2fd/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(五)ADB 诊断与证据.md","articleTitle":"App测试(五)ADB 诊断与证据","articlePath":"posts/16f2c2fd/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Crash 和 ANR 的核心区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Crash 是进程异常退出，ANR 是关键线程在规定时间内没有响应。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Crash (崩溃) 表示 App 进程因为未处理异常、native signal 等原因退出；ANR (Application Not Responding, 应用无响应) 表示 Android 在规定时间内没有得到主线程或某个组件的响应，进程不一定已经退出。\u003ccode>logcat\u003c/code> 是查看系统/App 时间线的工具，\u003ccode>traces\u003c/code> 是记录线程当时调用栈的诊断工件；它们都是证据，不是“页面卡住”本身的定义。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>现象\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>先确认的证据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>不能直接推出\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Crash\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>进程是否退出、\u003ccode>FATAL EXCEPTION\u003c/code>/native signal 和退出时间\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>一定是 UI 卡死\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ANR\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>系统是否生成 ANR 报告、主线程在等待什么、操作是否超时\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>一定是网络问题\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>两者都可能让用户看到界面消失或无响应；判断时要把进程状态、线程状态、\u003ccode>logcat\u003c/code> 和系统报告对齐。证据不足时保留“待归因”，不要只凭录屏强行分类。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a4-grep-selection","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["grep","正则"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取.md","articleTitle":"Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取","articlePath":"posts/33859692/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取.md","articleTitle":"Linux(四)文本处理与数据提取","articlePath":"posts/33859692/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>grep、grep -E 和 grep -F 如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>grep 处理基本正则，grep -E 处理扩展正则，grep -F 按固定字符串匹配。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三种模式的边界可以直接对照：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;axb&#x27;\u003c/span> &gt; sample.txt\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">grep \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;\u003c/span> sample.txt       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 基本正则，点号匹配任意字符\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">grep -E \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;a\\.b&#x27;\u003c/span> sample.txt   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 扩展正则，仍需转义字面点号\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">grep -F \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;a.b&#x27;\u003c/span> sample.txt    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 固定字符串，只匹配字面 a.b\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>旧入口 \u003ccode>egrep\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>fgrep\u003c/code> 迁移为 \u003ccode>grep -E\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>grep -F\u003c/code>。模式来自用户输入时优先 \u003ccode>-F\u003c/code>，除非业务明确需要正则；这样既少一层转义，也降低把输入当成表达式的风险。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-07-index-design-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["联合索引","覆盖索引","ICP"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(七)索引原理与设计.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(七)索引原理与设计","articlePath":"posts/12331af3/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(七)索引原理与设计.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(七)索引原理与设计","articlePath":"posts/12331af3/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>查询 \u003ccode>orders\u003c/code> 中某用户的 paid 订单，按时间和 id 倒序取前 20 行；如何比较覆盖索引与 ICP，避免只凭索引名称下结论？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE\u003c/span> INDEX idx_orders_user_status_time_cover\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> orders (user_id, status, ordered_at, id, total_amount);\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">CREATE\u003c/span> INDEX idx_orders_user_status_time\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ON\u003c/span> orders (user_id, status, ordered_at, id);\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">EXPLAIN ANALYZE\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id, ordered_at, total_amount\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">7\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;2026-07-01&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">100\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DESC\u003c/span>, id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DESC\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">LIMIT \u003cspan class=\"number\">20\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两个候选索引解决的成本不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>候选\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>查询列是否全在索引中\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>重点观察\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>(user_id, status, ordered_at, id, total_amount)\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>是\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可能出现 \u003ccode>Using index\u003c/code>，但索引更宽、写放大更高\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>(user_id, status, ordered_at, id)\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>否\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>需要回表，残余条件可能出现 \u003ccode>Using index condition\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>EXPLAIN ANALYZE\u003c/code> 才能给出实际扫描行数、耗时和回表代价；\u003ccode>Extra\u003c/code> 中的文字只是一个线索。先在同一数据规模和统计信息下比较，再决定是否隐藏或删除索引，并检查唯一约束、主键边界和其他查询是否受影响。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-monkeypatch-vs-mock","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["替身选择"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(七)隔离环境与测试替身","articlePath":"posts/1d2bf183/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>monkeypatch 与 mock 应如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>monkeypatch 适合可逆地修改环境、属性和字典；mock 适合记录调用并验证交互协议。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>选择取决于你需要留下哪一种证据：\u003ccode>monkeypatch\u003c/code> 让环境在测试期间可控并在结束时恢复，\u003ccode>Mock\u003c/code> 额外记录调用交互。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> unittest.mock \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> patch\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_env\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">monkeypatch\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    monkeypatch.setenv(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;REGION&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;test&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> read_region() == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;test&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 验证结果\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_notifier\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> patch(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;service.send&quot;\u003c/span>, return_value=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> send:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> notify(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;paid&quot;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        send.assert_called_once_with(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;paid&quot;\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 验证交互契约\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>只需要控制配置、时间或路径时用 monkeypatch；调用次数、参数或顺序就是接口协议时用 Mock。即使用 Mock 验证交互，也应保留一个公开结果断言，避免测试只证明“替身被调用”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-parametrize-vs-subtests","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["用例模型"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(六)参数化与用例建模","articlePath":"posts/f6690364/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>参数化与 subtests 的失败粒度和收集模型有何不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>参数化在收集阶段为每组数据生成独立 Node；subtests 通常在一次测试体中循环，共享调用上下文。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>参数化发生在收集阶段，每组数据都有自己的 Node ID、标记和失败位置；subtests 通常发生在一次测试函数执行期间，所有数据共享该次 setup。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">9\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">10\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">11\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">12\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">13\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> unittest\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.parametrize(\u003cspan class=\"params\">\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;value&quot;\u003c/span>, [\u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>], ids=[\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;zero&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;one&quot;\u003c/span>]\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_value\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">value\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> value &gt;= \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">TestWithSubtests\u003c/span>(unittest.TestCase):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_values\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> value \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">            \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.subTest(value=value):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">                \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.assertGreaterEqual(value, \u003cspan class=\"number\">0\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>需要 \u003ccode>tests.py::test_value[one]\u003c/code> 这种 Pytest 级精确复跑时选参数化；只有必须共享一次昂贵准备且运行器能提供足够子测试报告时，才保留 subtests。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-discount-shipping","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","优惠","判定表"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>给定优惠与运费规则，如何设计组合测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>列出会员、满额、地区等条件，先标互斥和优先级，再用判定表覆盖全满足、单条件和不可行组合。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先确认优惠是否可叠加、满额按折前还是折后金额、地区是否免邮。代表列应包括：会员且满额且免邮；只有会员；只有满额；不满足任何条件；互斥优惠同时出现。预期写折扣金额、运费、最终金额和订单记录，不能只看页面标签。若不可行组合由规则明确禁止，标记为约束而非强行制造数据。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-cup-full","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","实物","功能拆解"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>给定一个杯子，如何设计功能测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先声明教学假设（有盖、常温水、容量范围），再按盛装、放置、持握、倾倒、开合和密封设计可观察用例。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>功能测试要围绕用途和操作，不把材质安全或寿命混进同一条“正常”。代表用例检查空杯、标称容量、少量/接近上限、盖紧后倒置、重复开合和放置稳定；预期写泄漏、盖锁定、容量和损坏状态。高温、危险破坏和真实认证不属于本练习。无盖、儿童杯、保温杯需求变化后重新拆解。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]